; ✅ RESOLVED 2026-07-16 — VERIFIED BOTH BACKENDS on trunk ad68c0a55. The differential is KILLED: wasm + rust now AGREE. case1 const (Ast.Float nan) → DECLINES uniformly (v-metaprogramming reify guard 28ff86659); case2 runtime (Ast.Float (- x nan)) → TRAPS uniformly on both (v-rust-backend 18609e0ed; wasm already trapped); control bare (- x nan) → value NaN both. Also closed the ast-lift twin (21ac0bb8d: ,nan active-unquote declines). SUPERSEDED BY OWNER GRADED PINS: v-metaprogramming pinned the canonical cases in 12-metaprogramming.sexp:897 ("reifying a constant NaN into an Ast.Float declines" + +inf/finite companions), gate 173/0/0 green. This loose reproducer is redundant with those graded pins — CLOSED (no flip/re-grade needed; owner owns the coverage). Operator (A) uniform-decline ruling stands; if operator later picks (B), owner reopens.
